      "title": "Accepted Students",
      "description": "Accepted Students - International | Lesley University Skip to main content Search Breadcrumb Home Admissions Admissions Accepted Students - Interna... Main Reach My Education Goals My Education Goals Reach My Education Goals Education Programs Undergraduate Programs Master's Programs PhD Programs Certificate Programs Mental Health & Well Being Programs Undergraduate Programs Master's Programs Counseling & Psychology Expressive Therapies Social Work PhD Programs Certificate Programs Art & Design Programs Undergraduate Programs MFA in Visual and Literary Arts Liberal Arts & Business Programs Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Certificate Programs Threshold Programs Life at Lesley Housing Threshold Housing Clubs and Activities Athletics Dining International Student Services (ISS) International F-1 and Form I-20 International Student Housing International Student Forms Travel Information Understanding Your Immigration Documents Maintaining Legal F-1 Status Work Authorization Practical Tips for International Students Student Support Resources Avoid Scams and Frauds Join Admissions Undergraduate Students How to Apply Admissions Visits & Events Accepted Students Submit Your Deposit Graduate Students How to Apply Education Programs Mental Health & Well-Being Programs Art & Design Programs Liberal Arts & Business Admissions Visits & Events Accepted Students Submit Your Deposit Transfer Students How to Apply Admissions Visits & Events Accepted Students Submit Your Deposit Mass Guarantee Degree Completion Students How to Apply Admissions Visits & Events Accepted Students Submit Your Deposit International Students How to Apply Admissions Visits & Events Accepted Students Submit Your Deposit Threshold Students How to Apply Admissions Visits & Events Accepted Students Submit Your Deposit Meet the Admissions Team Costs & Financial Aid Options for Financing Your Education Private Scholarships Maine Scholars Program Urban Scholars Initiative Hometown Scholars Camões Scholars Understand the Cost of Attending Lesley Secure Your Funding and Pay Your Bill Student Financial Services Policies My Professional & Life Goals My Professional & Life Goals Reach My Professional & Life Goals Continuing Education Education Mental Health & Well-Being Art & Design Liberal Arts & Business Threshold Programs Professional Networks Priority Job Matching Program Alumni Engagement My Organization's Goals My Organization's Goals Reach My Organization's Goals Recruit Talent Become a Scholar Partner Priority Job Matching Program Retain Talent My Philanthropic Goals My Philanthropic Goals Reach My Philanthropic Goals Support Education at Lesley Support Mental Health & Well-Being Support Art & Design Support Liberal Arts & Business Support Threshold Campus Renovations and Future Vision Emerald Key Society Give Online Explore About Lesley About Lesley Explore About Lesley Leadership Faculty Strategic Framework Scholar Partner Program Fall Weekend 2026 Thought Leadership Series Work at Lesley Equity, Diversity, Inclusion, and Justice Updates from the President News & Stories Events Facility Rentals Contact Internal Internal Internal Academic Meetings and Selected Community Events 2026-2027 Brand Center Services Directory Support Hub Course Catalog myLesley Lesley Experience Portal Policies & Legal Academic Calendar Academic Catalog Institutional Review Board (IRB) MBTA Passes Veteran Benefits & Resources Accepted Students - International Welcome to Your Home Away from Home Congratulations on your acceptance, we’re thrilled to welcome you to Lesley. As an international student, you bring unique perspectives and experiences to our community. We’re here to help you settle in, get connected, and feel at home. From understanding life in the U.S. to navigating visas, housing, and academics, we’re with you every step of the way. To lock in your spot in the upcoming class, go ahead and submit this form . Good news: no funds are needed to submit your deposit today! Once you hit submit, one of our friendly admissions counselors will reach out to help you tackle the next steps in your enrollment adventure. Be sure to review the important resources we’ve developed for accepted students, and ​ reach out to the admissions team if you have questions or need additional information. ​​Resources for Accepted Undergraduate Students ​​​Resources for Accepted Graduate Students Take the next step Ready to begin your journey with Lesley? ​Share some basic information by filling out one of the forms below so that we can reach out to you with more information about our programs. Or, email admissions@lesley.edu to connect with a member of our admissions team. Undergraduate & Transfer: Inquiry Form Close | Visit | Apply Graduate: Inquiry Form Close | Visit | Apply Threshold Programs: Inquiry Form Close | Visit | Apply Lesley University Lesley University 29 Everett St, Cambridge, MA, 02138 617-868-9600 | Contact Lesley | Work at Lesley Instagram X LinkedIn Facebook YouTube Lesley is more than a university. We are an education and resource hub that educates and supports the world’s best practitioners in Education, Mental Health & Well-Being, Art & Design, Liberal Arts & Business. Lesley also educates neurodiverse learners through its innovative Threshold Programs. Learn more about Lesley ! Request Info Visit Apply Accessibility Privacy Policy Non-Discrimination Notice Accreditation © 2026 Lesley University"
